ta></custom-meta-wrap></article-meta></front><body><p>Correction for:</p><p>Khaw KT, Wareham N, Bingham S, Welch A, Luben R, et al. (2008) Combined impact of health behaviours and mortality in men and women: The EPIC-Norfolk Prospective Population Study. PLoS Med 5(1): e12. doi:<ext-link ext-link-type="doi" xlink:href="10.1371/journal.pmed.0050012">10.1371/journal.pmed.0050012</ext-link></p><p>An error was made with the cutoff vitamin C level reported in this paper (&#x0003e;50 mmol/l). The units should have been given in micromoles per litre, not millimoles per litre, for vitamin C. Throughout the manuscript, wherever &#x0003e;50 mmol/l is given as the cutoff, &#x0003e;50 micromol/l is the correct vitamin C level that should have been reported.</p></body></article>